{
  "generator": "built-in image_gen",
  "style": "original picture-book interpretations; consistent character designs",
  "book_count": 5,
  "page_count": 30,
  "files": [
    {
      "book": "adventure_zootopia_07",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "动物城儿童剧场要演《月亮回家》，可彩排到最后一幕时，圆圆的月亮影偶怎么也找不到。小演员们举着空空的木杆，舞台帷幕后只剩一片黑色。离正式演出只剩一个小时。",
      "file": "art/story-quality-v2/adventure_zootopia_07/page1.webp",
      "bytes": 66178,
      "sha256": "8b9169f4a964a958f7959f73ca517fcedef5157fad71b42e52c6509535a5f46e",
      "size": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "book": "adventure_zootopia_07",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "朱迪检查道具清单，月亮昨晚还在。尼克注意到工作台上有一圈银色亮粉，亮粉一路延伸到装彩色滤光片的盒子，却没有任何东西掉在地上。这条亮亮的线索很特别。",
      "file": "art/story-quality-v2/adventure_zootopia_07/page2.webp",
      "bytes": 76364,
      "sha256": "145018c733a882d9445d839b5dff438b4a1391d721c6e435028c321e00935952",
      "size": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "book": "adventure_zootopia_07",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "盒子里叠着红、蓝、黄色薄片，最下面还粘着一片透明圆纸。朱迪把它举到灯前，幕布上出现淡淡的圆影。原来月亮不是丢了，而是和透明滤片贴在一起。尼克终于认出了它。",
      "file": "art/story-quality-v2/adventure_zootopia_07/page3.webp",
      "bytes": 62756,
      "sha256": "77b4b287ace068579f04c507cf89d75f19dda5534e90cb717e6118523812fd75",
      "size": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "book": "adventure_zootopia_07",
      "page": 4,
      "text": "尼克把透明圆片装回木杆，可灯一亮，月亮仍然太淡。小演员有点失望。朱迪在圆片边缘贴一圈深色纸，再让灯光稍微靠近，轮廓终于清清楚楚。淡淡的月亮重新变得醒目。",
      "file": "art/story-quality-v2/adventure_zootopia_07/page4.webp",
      "bytes": 68774,
      "sha256": "c188fba651f659ea0e837d3746bc6c4d4aed32b98ec43a1c0758ca8396fac6a4",
      "size": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "book": "adventure_zootopia_07",
      "page": 5,
      "text": "最后一幕重新彩排：透明月亮先躲在蓝云后，慢慢露出银色边缘。尼克轻轻转动滤片，月光从蓝色变成暖黄，小演员们顺利说完了告别台词。舞台帷幕后的伙伴都松了口气。",
      "file": "art/story-quality-v2/adventure_zootopia_07/page5.webp",
      "bytes": 62976,
      "sha256": "e7e8ea4991e4a3ce8112fb6884c0a258f266463ee45ebf7977a3bd1d0e83eb06",
      "size": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "book": "adventure_zootopia_07",
      "page": 6,
      "text": "正式演出时，观众为会变颜色的月亮鼓掌。朱迪把透明道具放进有月亮图案的独立袋。尼克说，有些东西不是消失了，只是和背景太像，需要换个光看看。小演员们也牢牢记住了。",
      "file": "art/story-quality-v2/adventure_zootopia_07/page6.webp",
      "bytes": 70598,
      "sha256": "54405797b4e954895eb53c551bb7011aaf1b333cee371f5ee22d1fd038a4794c",
      "size": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "book": "extra_elsa_snowfox",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "雪后，艾莎和安娜在松林散步，听见树丛里传来细细的叫声。一只小雪狐找不到回家的脚印了。",
      "file": "art/story-quality-v2/extra_elsa_snowfox/page1.webp",
      "bytes": 118090,
      "sha256": "aa595bcdea551f31856b0b780bde8c581f1948edf6914fff7a21b1b25192e43b",
      "size": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "book": "extra_elsa_snowfox",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "艾莎想铺出一条冰路，可小雪狐一踩就打滑。她马上停下，蹲下来看看雪地里还有什么线索。",
      "file": "art/story-quality-v2/extra_elsa_snowfox/page2.webp",
      "bytes": 122226,
      "sha256": "63f5e4f075667b33a953a116a51c86b3f01934e2ebccb3086c194d85ffd8900c",
      "size": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "book": "extra_elsa_snowfox",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "安娜发现松枝上粘着白色绒毛，雪地里还有半个梅花形脚印。她们决定沿着线索慢慢找，不漏掉一处。",
      "file": "art/story-quality-v2/extra_elsa_snowfox/page3.webp",
      "bytes": 126312,
      "sha256": "b6b1380989f97974f23ec4f7a3f54e5ad380cecd08f2e63f4ec6c5e76c6a9d82",
      "size": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "book": "extra_elsa_snowfox",
      "page": 4,
      "text": "风又吹来，脚印快看不见了。艾莎做出一排低低的冰晶路标，让小雪狐能看见方向，却不会滑倒。",
      "file": "art/story-quality-v2/extra_elsa_snowfox/page4.webp",
      "bytes": 123268,
      "sha256": "9f5eacc680747a06e02b6c395ae44a0102e7e6cde8fefb6cda78987301b06a24",
      "size": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "book": "extra_elsa_snowfox",
      "page": 5,
      "text": "越过小山坡，一只大雪狐正在洞口焦急等待。小雪狐跑回妈妈身边，用尾巴向姐妹俩道谢。",
      "file": "art/story-quality-v2/extra_elsa_snowfox/page5.webp",
      "bytes": 120850,
      "sha256": "dce07391ab0afd8a1101c47872a49acacddee997851c34f3ad7a6cea87c08c84",
      "size": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "book": "extra_elsa_snowfox",
      "page": 6,
      "text": "回城的路上，艾莎说，帮助别人要先了解它真正需要什么。安娜点头，把这句话记进了旅行本。",
      "file": "art/story-quality-v2/extra_elsa_snowfox/page6.webp",
      "bytes": 137400,
      "sha256": "99539302fcdc17f6251e3637da9071fc46b4b70debd7ef15ca81e5c0ac98e807",
      "size": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "book": "extra_elsa_snowlight",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "阿伦黛尔要办冬日灯会，艾莎用冰晶做了六盏雪花灯。清晨，她发现最小的一盏正在慢慢融化。",
      "file": "art/story-quality-v2/extra_elsa_snowlight/page1.webp",
      "bytes": 138676,
      "sha256": "db34a17171d4d76f5b0bae24223e34603c57d00e8d4c5b38930ed4a669347e96",
      "size": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "book": "extra_elsa_snowlight",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "艾莎想用更强的寒气冻住它，安娜却指着窗外说，今天阳光很暖，也许小灯需要一把遮阳伞。",
      "file": "art/story-quality-v2/extra_elsa_snowlight/page2.webp",
      "bytes": 95212,
      "sha256": "9e858fe3119d35ec605a4b1b4a814a2f07469fd8a03291ec6aad6b2c825f9546",
      "size": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "book": "extra_elsa_snowlight",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "姐妹俩把雪花灯搬到树荫下，又请孩子们用彩纸做小伞。小灯终于停止融化，大家开心地笑了。",
      "file": "art/story-quality-v2/extra_elsa_snowlight/page3.webp",
      "bytes": 156730,
      "sha256": "8b3f7bb6f100076008c4a47539a70d578977dc9e87d3f5df20534c2b61799e81",
      "size": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "book": "extra_elsa_snowlight",
      "page": 4,
      "text": "傍晚云朵遮住太阳，艾莎只用一点点魔法补好裂纹。她发现细心观察，比一味加大力量更有用。",
      "file": "art/story-quality-v2/extra_elsa_snowlight/page4.webp",
      "bytes": 94996,
      "sha256": "fcc9493a4e0afdeef76a686338087efa799aa6ac88c91a71b7197e3680601edd",
      "size": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "book": "extra_elsa_snowlight",
      "page": 5,
      "text": "六盏灯在广场亮起，冰面映着蓝白色的光。孩子们围着最小的雪花灯，轻轻唱起冬日歌，歌声暖暖的。",
      "file": "art/story-quality-v2/extra_elsa_snowlight/page5.webp",
      "bytes": 118166,
      "sha256": "0a819027557fb75bade1ac2715dda1819723a99ef20043e1ff3764f033017d43",
      "size": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "book": "extra_elsa_snowlight",
      "page": 6,
      "text": "艾莎把小伞留在灯旁，提醒自己先看清需要，再使用魔法。温柔和耐心，也能保护美丽的东西。",
      "file": "art/story-quality-v2/extra_elsa_snowlight/page6.webp",
      "bytes": 111692,
      "sha256": "3b706963f6875542b62adee8b67927a882c71bfbd83e9dafeceea39f74dab11a",
      "size": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "book": "extra_princess_cinderella",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "从前有位善良的姑娘灰姑娘，她每天辛勤做家务，却常被继母和姐姐们欺负，连参加舞会的衣服也没有。",
      "file": "art/story-quality-v2/extra_princess_cinderella/page1.webp",
      "bytes": 103410,
      "sha256": "4e02a85fd00457c8200634571ec3d48403d9ec70b153f603d68ce78c7537fd6b",
      "size": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "book": "extra_princess_cinderella",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "舞会那天，一位仙女教母来到花园。她把南瓜变成马车，又为灰姑娘准备了闪亮的礼服和水晶鞋。",
      "file": "art/story-quality-v2/extra_princess_cinderella/page2.webp",
      "bytes": 158354,
      "sha256": "079cf851d4a7dbbeb8ce733c6265a1a8489809250e6cd25e3e183b262d587e06",
      "size": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "book": "extra_princess_cinderella",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "仙女提醒她，魔法会在午夜十二点消失。灰姑娘来到王宫，与王子跳舞，度过了快乐的夜晚。",
      "file": "art/story-quality-v2/extra_princess_cinderella/page3.webp",
      "bytes": 114152,
      "sha256": "110e7e2a3ca644b22fb4008e6d25ab8f9ab65323eca4ea290116c321c42fc97f",
      "size": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "book": "extra_princess_cinderella",
      "page": 4,
      "text": "钟声响起，灰姑娘急忙离开，一只水晶鞋落在台阶上。马车变回南瓜，她平安跑回了家，没有受伤。",
      "file": "art/story-quality-v2/extra_princess_cinderella/page4.webp",
      "bytes": 120880,
      "sha256": "313ebac1dda337f0d90b516c18126d5010f59f83fcc33ddcb3f1b5e10189aae1",
      "size": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "book": "extra_princess_cinderella",
      "page": 5,
      "text": "王子带着水晶鞋寻找主人。许多人都穿不上，直到灰姑娘轻轻把脚放进去，鞋子正好合适。",
      "file": "art/story-quality-v2/extra_princess_cinderella/page5.webp",
      "bytes": 101848,
      "sha256": "1284a0ccbca3ded810c786dfa96bb1e761c7891855a385438c8d925b660b1184",
      "size": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "book": "extra_princess_cinderella",
      "page": 6,
      "text": "王子认出了舞会上的姑娘。灰姑娘勇敢开始新生活，也始终保持善良，尊重每一位帮助过她的人。",
      "file": "art/story-quality-v2/extra_princess_cinderella/page6.webp",
      "bytes": 147404,
      "sha256": "41a0fbac40a44442729cc50e65605b8723b94b5014b1d48184e9ba78d00403b8",
      "size": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "book": "extra_princess_snowwhite",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "从前有位心地善良的公主，大家叫她白雪公主。王后嫉妒她受人喜爱，命令她离开王宫，独自走进森林。",
      "file": "art/story-quality-v2/extra_princess_snowwhite/page1.webp",
      "bytes": 97752,
      "sha256": "f0a5371f90035a30b96b7683f47d19367c9f45c087fb90cbdd7a73a94f5b2c65",
      "size": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "book": "extra_princess_snowwhite",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "白雪公主走进森林，天黑时发现一座整洁的小屋。屋里住着七位勤劳的小矮人，他们热情收留了她。",
      "file": "art/story-quality-v2/extra_princess_snowwhite/page2.webp",
      "bytes": 98402,
      "sha256": "b466203f54ce4eec353c4974a7419c7dcc88864a862eea13acaa46e6a9f6f6ec",
      "size": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "book": "extra_princess_snowwhite",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "小矮人每天去山里工作，临走前提醒她不要给陌生人开门。白雪公主答应留在屋里等他们回来。",
      "file": "art/story-quality-v2/extra_princess_snowwhite/page3.webp",
      "bytes": 123430,
      "sha256": "41798d3018e9e56e5510559cb7cadb1acaf04b27291b2fe5d1bc31da3d7cb17f",
      "size": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "book": "extra_princess_snowwhite",
      "page": 4,
      "text": "王后乔装成卖苹果的老妇人，递来一个有毒的红苹果。白雪公主忘了提醒，咬一口后沉沉睡去。",
      "file": "art/story-quality-v2/extra_princess_snowwhite/page4.webp",
      "bytes": 92534,
      "sha256": "c94a5198f9421c426288bdf9dd43edcf7dacf7429bfdc8ec03efb13948ecd413",
      "size": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "book": "extra_princess_snowwhite",
      "page": 5,
      "text": "小矮人悲伤地守着她。邻国王子听说后赶来帮忙，抬动水晶棺时，卡在喉咙里的苹果掉了出来。",
      "file": "art/story-quality-v2/extra_princess_snowwhite/page5.webp",
      "bytes": 100274,
      "sha256": "df802c311e5156d0199ab3d22106103ad106420c8cc469a55f589f4c87004945",
      "size": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "book": "extra_princess_snowwhite",
      "page": 6,
      "text": "白雪公主醒来，感谢朋友们的守护。她也记住了重要的安全规则：不能随便接受陌生人的食物。",
      "file": "art/story-quality-v2/extra_princess_snowwhite/page6.webp",
      "bytes": 96178,
      "sha256": "65b519c8987f30e9fb8fe5534e085743cdb6ea1f816271a080864a3ad8d9f5da",
      "size": [
        720,
        720
      ]
    }
  ],
